    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d474">

                <pb facs="0450" n="334" xml:id="pg334"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 859.001F87/7.]</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Chargé d’Affaires</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 21, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In view of the absence of Mr. Egan and impossibility of sending a Special
                    Representative, owing to lack of time, you will consider this your credentials
                    as Special Envoy for the funeral ceremonies. Explain situation to Foreign
                    Office.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
